Me\"). \n\nHere is the Imgur album with reference images for the request: https://imgur.com/a/Q3QlIO2\n\nI have included a stick art sketch I drew up for the poster composition in the Imgur album (1st image). \n\nI have also included an annotated copy that draws attention so specific details I would like in the poster (2nd image). \n\nA full body image of the vtuber model, which I have the rights to, is also included (3rd image, if you need more images please let me know). \n\nI included an image of a figurine with the pose I would like in the poster (4th image).\n\nThe initial idea for this poster was inspired by the theatrical poster for the 1966 film The Crazy-Quilt, which I have included as a reference which may help illuminate the vibe I am going for (5th image). \n\n\nPlease let me know if you would be interested in this request! I love tuning into your art streams on Youtube and would be ecstatic if you would be able to complete this!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@HirusakiTique/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2305142, "client_id": 3860360, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a78157b77d943384d9f6721fd34a32", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a78157b77d943384d9f6721fd34a32, https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1221393b98a3308ae5e583b161c323b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ecbae34/uploads/origins/6542c72f-60e3-4ee8-8c7e-309448c56c23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&cro